--- !u!114 &1651448837
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1651448834}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a11dd23e08e5cb942a6a6b4da8d43711, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: TEXDrawRuntime::TexDrawLib.TEXDraw
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_Alignment: {x: 0.5, y: 0.5}
  m_Text: "That\u2019s Correct!\r\n\r\nWe are asked to find the probability that
    a character uses Fire Magic or Ice Magic.\r\n\r\nThe given information is:\r\n\nP(Fire
    Magic) = 0.60\n\r\nP(Ice Magic) = 0.45\n\r\nP(Fire and Ice) = 0.25\r\n\r\nWe
    can calculate the probability using the formula for \u201Cor\u201D:\r\n\r\nP(Fire
    or Ice) = P(Fire) + P(Ice) - P(Fire and Ice)\r\n\r\nP(Fire or Ice) = 0.60 + 0.45
    - 0.25\r\n\r\nP(Fire or Ice) = 0.80\r\n\r\nSo, the probability that a character
    uses Fire Magic or Ice Magic is 0.80 or 80\\%.\r\n\r\nThis means that 8 out of
    10 characters are expected to have at least one of these two magic skills.\r\n"
  m_Size: 6
  m_ScrollArea:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 0
    y: 0
    width: 0
    height: 0
  m_Padding:
    left: 10
    right: 10
    top: 10
    bottom: 10
  m_Overflow: 0
